"true">English</a><a class="LanguageMenu-link" href="/zh/" hreflang="zh" lang="zh">中文</a><a class="LanguageMenu-link" href="/ja/" hreflang="ja" lang="ja">日本語</a></div></details></div><h1>Breaker Delta</h1><bd-island name="ThemeSwitch" props="{&quot;toDark&quot;:&quot;Switch to dark mode&quot;,&quot;toLight&quot;:&quot;Switch to light mode&quot;}"><button type="button" class="ThemeSwitch"><svg class="ThemeSwitch-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="ThemeSwitch-ring" cx="10" cy="10" r="7.5" stroke-width="2"></circle><path class="ThemeSwitch-half" d="M10 2.5 A7.5 7.5 0 0 1 10 17.5 Z"></path></svg><span class="ThemeSwitch-name ThemeSwitch-to-dark">Switch to dark mode</span><span class="ThemeSwitch-name ThemeSwitch-to-light">Switch to light mode</span></button></bd-island></header><main class="page"><section class="Band" data-variant="front" aria-labelledby="band-front"><div class="Band-rail"><h2 id="band-front" class="Band-name">Front page</h2></div><div class="Band-body"><p>The 14:00 edition. Sea state: choppy. 16 waves up, 5 new today.</p><div class="Headline"><article class="Headline-lead"><p class="Headline-kicker">Tallest wave right now</p><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-lead" data-height="196"><a class="Headline-link" href="/topic/chipmaker-board-founder-ceo" lang="en">Chipmaker board rules out bringing back its founder CEO</a></h3><div class="Headline-figures"><svg class="EchoStack" viewBox="0 0 120 220" role="img" aria-label="Echoes stacking into a wave, 12 layers high"><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="4" y="199" width="100" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="8.6" y="185" width="94" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="12.7" y="171" width="89" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="17.3" y="157" width="83" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="21.4" y="143" width="78" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="26" y="129" width="72" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="30.6" y="115" width="66" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="34.7" y="101" width="61" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="39.3" y="87" width="55" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="43.4" y="73" width="50" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="48" y="59" width="44" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-top" x="52.6" y="45" width="38" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><path class="EchoStack-base" d="M2,214 H118"></path></svg><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-lead Headline-new" value="196">196</data><div class="Headline-trend"><svg class="Headline-chart" viewBox="0 0 520 110" role="img" aria-label="Wave height of the tallest story up to 14:00"><path class="Headline-chart-area" d="M4,37 L77,41 L150,45 L223,48 L297,50 L370,23 L443,16 L516,12 L516,104 L4,104 Z"></path><path class="Headline-chart-line" pathLength="1" d="M4,37 L77,41 L150,45 L223,48 L297,50 L370,23 L443,16 L516,12"></path><path class="Headline-chart-base" d="M4,104 L516,104"></path></svg><p class="Headline-lead-note"><strong>Up 63% in 24 hours.</strong> 6 independent sources, 31 echoes.</p></div></div></article><div class="Headline-columns Headline-columns-second"><article class="Headline-story Headline-second"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-second Headline-new" value="181">181</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-second" data-height="181"><a class="Headline-link" href="/topic/ai-lab-sued-over-agents" lang="en">State attorney general sues an AI lab over 80 rogue-agent incidents</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">New today.<span class="Headline-meta"> 4 independent sources, 14 echoes.</span></p></article><article class="Headline-story Headline-second"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-second Headline-new" value="171">171</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-second" data-height="171"><a class="Headline-link" href="/topic/six-banks-offline" lang="en">Six US banks go offline on the same afternoon</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">New today.<span class="Headline-meta"> 5 independent sources, 12 echoes.</span></p></article></div><div class="Headline-columns Headline-columns-third"><article class="Headline-story Headline-third"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-third Headline-new" value="151">151</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-third" data-height="151"><a class="Headline-link" href="/topic/ai-hacking-tool-warning" lang="en">Security agency warns about an open-source AI hacking tool</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">New today.</p></article><article class="Headline-story Headline-third"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-third" value="144">144</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-third Headline-fading" data-height="144"><a class="Headline-link" href="/topic/frontier-model-backlash" lang="en">New frontier model keeps drawing benchmarks and backlash</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">Down 18% in 24 hours.</p></article><article class="Headline-story Headline-third"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-third Headline-new" value="131">131</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-third" data-height="131"><a class="Headline-link" href="/topic/decoy-discounts" lang="en">Black Friday decoy discounts: 29% of 351 deals saved nothing</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">New today.</p></article></div><p class="Headline-key">Headline size follows wave height. Red formed today. Lighter ink is fading.</p></div></div><div class="Band-aside"><bd-island name="Index" props="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;The index&quot;,&quot;order&quot;:&quot;by height&quot;,&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/topic/chipmaker