"200 text/html; charset=utf-8
<!doctype html><html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Breaker Delta</title><script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem("bd-theme");if(t==="light"||t==="dark")document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t}catch(e){}</script><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/fraunces-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/fraunces-italic-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/instrument-sans-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/client/ui.css"/><script type="module" src="/client/loader.js"></script><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon-32.png" sizes="32x32" type="image/png"/><link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon-16.png" sizes="16x16" type="image/png"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/apple-touch-icon.png"/><link rel="manifest" href="/icons/manifest.webmanifest"/><link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="http://site/"/><link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh" href="http://site/zh/"/><link rel="alternate" hreflang="ja" href="http://site/ja/"/><link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="http://site/"/></head><body><header class="page"><div class="LanguageMenu"><details class="LanguageMenu-details" data-menu><summary class="LanguageMenu-button" aria-label="言語：日本語"><svg class="LanguageMenu-icon" viewBox="0 0 18 18" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="7"></circle><path d="M2 9 H16 M9 2 C5.5 5.5 5.5 12.5 9 16 C12.5 12.5 12.5 5.5 9 2"></path></svg><span class="LanguageMenu-current">日本語</span><svg class="LanguageMenu-chevron" viewBox="0 0 12 8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 1 L6 6 L11 1"></path></svg></summary><div class="LanguageMenu-list"><a class="LanguageMenu-link" href="/" hreflang="en" lang="en">English</a><a class="LanguageMenu-link" href="/zh/" hreflang="zh" lang="zh">中文</a><a class="LanguageMenu-link" href="/ja/" hreflang="ja" lang="ja" aria-current="true">日本語</a></div></details></div><h1>Breaker Delta</h1><bd-island name="ThemeSwitch" props="{&quot;toDark&quot;:&quot;ダークモードに切り替える&quot;,&quot;toLight&quot;:&quot;ライトモードに切り替える&quot;}"><button type="button" class="ThemeSwitch"><svg class="ThemeSwitch-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="ThemeSwitch-ring" cx="10" cy="10" r="7.5" stroke-width="2"></circle><path class="ThemeSwitch-half" d="M10 2.5 A7.5 7.5 0 0 1 10 17.5 Z"></path></svg><span class="ThemeSwitch-name ThemeSwitch-to-dark">ダークモードに切り替える</span><span class="ThemeSwitch-name ThemeSwitch-to-light">ライトモードに切り替える</span></button></bd-island></header><main class="page"><section class="Band" data-variant="front" aria-labelledby="band-front"><div class="Band-rail"><h2 id="band-front" class="Band-name">一面</h2></div><div class="Band-body"><p>14:00 版。海況：波あり。波は16、きょう新たに5。</p><div class="Headline"><article class="Headline-lead"><p class="Headline-kicker">いまいちばん高い波</p><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-lead" data-height="196"><a class="Headline-link" href="/ja/topic/chipmaker-board-founder-ceo" lang="ja">半導体大手の取締役会、創業者の CEO 復帰を否定</a></h3><div class="Headline-figures"><svg class="EchoStack" viewBox="0 0 120 220" role="img" aria-label="エコーが重なって波に、12 層の高さ"><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="4" y="199" width="100" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="8.6" y="185" width="94" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="12.7" y="171" width="89" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="17.3" y="157" width="83" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="21.4" y="143" width="78" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="26" y="129" width="72" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="30.6" y="115" width="66" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="34.7" y="101" width="61" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="39.3" y="87" width="55" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="43.4" y="73" width="50" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="48" y="59" width="44" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-top" x="52.6" y="45" width="38" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><path class="EchoStack-base" d="M2,214 H118"></path></svg><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-lead Headline-new" value="196">196</data><div class="Headline-trend"><svg class="Headline-chart" viewBox="0 0 520 110" role="img" aria-label="いちばん高い記事の 14:00 までの波高"><path class="Headline-chart-area" d="M4,37 L77,41 L150,45 L223,48 L297,50 L370,23 L443,16 L516,12 L516,104 L4,104 Z"></path><path class="Headline-chart-line" pathLength="1" d="M4,37 L77,41 L150,45 L223,48 L297,50 L370,23 L443,16 L516,12"></path><path class="Headline-chart-base" d="M4,104 L516,104"></path></svg><p class="Headline-lead-note"><strong>24 時間で 63% 上昇。</strong> 独立した情報源 6、エコー 31。</p></div></div></article><div class="Headline-columns Headline-columns-second"><article class="Headline-story Headline-second"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-second Headline-new" value="181">181</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-second" data-height="181"><a class="Headline-link" href="/ja/topic/ai-lab-sued-over-agents" lang="ja">州司法長官、暴走エージェント 80 件で AI 研究所を提訴</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">きょうできた波。<span class="Headline-meta"> 独立した情報源 4、エコー 14。</span></p></article><article class="Headline-story Headline-second"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-second Headline-new" value="171">171</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-second" data-height="171"><a class="Headline-link" href="/ja/topic/six-banks-offline" lang="ja">米銀 6 行、同じ午後に相次いで停止</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">きょうできた波。<span class="Headline-meta"> 独立した情報源 5、エコー 12。</span></p></article></div><div class="Headline-columns Headline-columns-third"><article class="Headline-story Headline-third"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-third Headline-new" value="151">151</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-third" data-height="151"><a class="Headline-link" href="/ja/topic/ai-hacking-tool-warning" lang="ja">セキュリティ機関、オープンソースの AI ハッキングツールに警告</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">きょうできた波。</p></article><article class="Headline-story Headline-third"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-third" value="144">144</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-third Headline-fading" data-height="144"><a class="Headline-link" href="/ja/topic/frontier-model-backlash" lang="ja">新フロンティアモデル、ベンチマークと反発が続く</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">24 時間で 18% 下降。</p></article><article class="Headline-story Headline-third"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-third Headline-new" value="131">131</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-third" data-height="131"><a class="Headline-link" href="/ja/topic/decoy-discounts" lang="ja">ブラックフライデーの見せかけ割引、351 件中 29% は安くならず</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">きょうできた波。</p></article></div><p class="Headline-key">見出しの大きさは波高に比例。赤はきょうできた波、薄い墨は引いていく波。</p></div></div><div class="Band-aside"><bd-island name="Index" props="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;索引&quot;,&quot;order&quot;:&quot;波高順&quot;,&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/ja/topic/chipmaker-board-founder-ceo&quot;,&quot;rank&quot;:1,&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;lang&quot;:&quot;ja&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;創業者 CEO 解任&quot;},&quot;height&quot;:196,&quot;formedToday&quot;:false,&quot;change&quot;:&quot;+63%&quot;},{&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/ja/topic/ai-lab-sued-over-agents&quot;,&quot;rank&quot;:2,&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;lang&quot;:&quot;ja&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;AI 研究所がエージェントで提訴&quot;},&quot;height&quot;:18