t explains its own error messages</a></li><li>GitHub breakout repositories: <a href="https://github.example/item/41002" lang="en">A vector database in a single file passes 4,000 stars in a day</a></li><li>Official blogs: <a href="https://official-blogs.example/item/41003" lang="en">Notes on giving agents a memory that survives restarts</a></li><li>Lobsters hottest: <a href="https://lobsters.example/item/41004" lang="en">A 4-bit model that runs on a three-year-old phone</a></li><li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41005" lang="en">The quiet return of RSS, by the numbers</a></li><li>Bluesky key accounts: <a href="https://bluesky.example/item/41006" lang="en">A browser vendor hints at built-in agent permissions</a></li><li>GitHub breakout repositories: <a href="https://github.example/item/41007" lang="en">A spreadsheet engine written in 900 lines</a></li><li>Official blogs: <a href="https://official-blogs.example/item/41008" lang="en">What we learned from a year of agent evaluations</a></li><li>Hacker News front page and Show HN: <a href="https://hackernews.example/item/41009" lang="en">Ask HN: who still self-hosts their email?</a></li><li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41010" lang="en">Chip export rules, explained in five charts</a></li><li>DEV.to top posts: <a href="https://devto.example/item/41011" lang="en">A keyboard firmware that learns your typos</a></li></ul><p><small>サンプルデータです。</small></p></div></section></main><footer class="Footer"><div class="Footer-top"><form class="Footer-form" method="post" action="/ja/subscribe"><label class="Footer-label" for="footer-email-P0-0">新しい波を、毎日一通のメールで。</label><input class="Footer-field" id="footer-email-P0-0" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"/><button class="Footer-submit" type="submit">購読する</button></form><nav class="Footer-nav" aria-label="フッター"><a class="Footer-link" href="/ja/about#