<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Breaker Delta</title><script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem("bd-theme");if(t==="light"||t==="dark")document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t}catch(e){}</script><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/fraunces-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/fraunces-italic-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/instrument-sans-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/client/ui.css"/><script type="module" src="/client/loader.js"></script><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon-32.png" sizes="32x32" type="image/png"/><link rel="icon" href="/icons/favicon-16.png" sizes="16x16" type="image/png"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/apple-touch-icon.png"/><link rel="manifest" href="/icons/manifest.webmanifest"/><link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="http://site/"/><link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="http://site/"/></head><body><header class="page"><h1>Breaker Delta</h1><bd-island name="ThemeSwitch" props="{&quot;toDark&quot;:&quot;Switch to dark mode&quot;,&quot;toLight&quot;:&quot;Switch to light mode&quot;}"><button type="button" class="ThemeSwitch"><svg class="ThemeSwitch-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="ThemeSwitch-ring" cx="10" cy="10" r="7.5" stroke-width="2"></circle><path class="ThemeSwitch-half" d="M10 2.5 A7.5 7.5 0 0 1 10 17.5 Z"></path></svg><span class="ThemeSwitch-name ThemeSwitch-to-dark">Switch to dark mode</span><span class="ThemeSwitch-name ThemeSwitch-to-light">Switch to light mode</span></button></bd-island></header><main class="page"><section class="Band" data-variant="front" aria-labelledby="band-front"><div class="Band-rail"><h2 id="band-front" class="Band-name">Front page</h2></div><div class="Band-body"><p>The 14:00 edition. Sea state: calm. 2 waves up, 1 new today.</p><div class="Headline"><article class="Headline-lead"><p class="Headline-kicker">Formed today, already the tallest</p><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-lead" data-height="126"><a class="Headline-link" href="/topic/open-weights-quarter-price" lang="en">Open-weights model released with pricing at 25% of flagship</a></h3><div class="Headline-figures"><svg class="EchoStack" viewBox="0 0 120 220" role="img" aria-label="Echoes stacking into a wave, 8 layers high"><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="4" y="199" width="100" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="8.6" y="185" width="94" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="12.7" y="171" width="89" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="17.3" y="157" width="83" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="21.4" y="143" width="78" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-sky" x="26" y="129" width="72" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-blue" x="30.6" y="115" width="66" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><rect class="EchoStack-sheet EchoStack-top" x="34.7" y="101" width="61" height="11" rx="5.5"></rect><path class="EchoStack-base" d="M2,214 H118"></path></svg><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-lead Headline-new" value="126">126</data><div class="Headline-trend"><svg class="Headline-chart" viewBox="0 0 520 110" role="img" aria-label="Wave height of the tallest story up to 14:00"><path class="Headline-chart-area" d="M4,60 L516,60 L516,104 L4,104 Z"></path><path class="Headline-chart-line" pathLength="1" d="M4,60 L516,60"></path><path class="Headline-chart-base" d="M4,104 L516,104"></path></svg><p class="Headline-lead-note"><strong>New today.</strong> 3 independent sources, 7 echoes.</p></div></div></article><div class="Headline-columns Headline-columns-second"><article class="Headline-story Headline-second"><data class="Headline-number Headline-number-second" value="80">80</data><h3 class="Headline-title Headline-title-second Headline-fading" data-height="080"><a class="Headline-link" href="/topic/super-agent-flash-model" lang="en">Lab releases a super-agent and a faster flash model</a></h3><p class="Headline-note">Down 21% in 24 hours.<span class="Headline-meta"> 3 independent sources, 8 echoes.</span></p></article></div><p class="Headline-key">Headline size follows wave height. Red formed today. Lighter ink is fading.</p></div></div><div class="Band-aside"><bd-island name="Index" props="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;index&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;The index&quot;,&quot;order&quot;:&quot;by height&quot;,&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/topic/open-weights-quarter-price&quot;,&quot;rank&quot;:1,&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;lang&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Open-weights model&quot;},&quot;height&quot;:126,&quot;formedToday&quot;:true,&quot;change&quot;:&quot;new&quot;},{&quot;href&quot;:&quot;/topic/super-agent-flash-model&quot;,&quot;rank&quot;:2,&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;lang&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Super-agent release&quot;},&quot;height&quot;:80,&quot;formedToday&quot;:false,&quot;change&quot;:&quot;−21%&quot;}],&quot;note&quot;:&quot;Red numbers formed today. The change is over 24 hours.&quot;,&quot;showAll&quot;:&quot;Show all 2 waves&quot;,&quot;showFewer&quot;:&quot;Show the top 8&quot;}"><aside class="Index" aria-labelledby="index-name"><div class="Index-head"><h2 id="index-name" class="Index-name">The index</h2><span class="Index-order">by height</span></div><ol id="index-list" class="Index-list"><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/topic/open-weights-quarter-price"><span class="IndexRow-rank">1</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Open-weights model</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change IndexRow-new">new</span><data class="IndexRow-number IndexRow-new" value="126">126</data></a></li><li class="Index-item"><a class="IndexRow" href="/topic/super-agent-flash-model"><span class="IndexRow-rank">2</span><span class="IndexRow-title" lang="en">Super-agent release</span><span class="IndexRow-leader" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="IndexRow-change">−21%</span><data class="IndexRow-number" value="80">80</data></a></li></ol><p class="Index-note">Red numbers formed today. The change is over 24 hours.</p></aside></bd-island></div></section><section class="Band" aria-labelledby="band-fading"><div class="Band-rail"><h2 id="band-fading" class="Band-name">Fading notices</h2><p class="Band-note">With nothing new, a wave loses height by the hour. We announce their decline with due respect.</p><div class="FadingNotices-rail"><svg class="FadingNotices-sunset" viewBox="0 0 240 120" role="img" aria-label="The sun setting over a flat sea"><path class="FadingNotices-sun" d="M70,84 A50,50 0 0 1 170,84 Z"></path><path class="FadingNotices-ink" d="M120,14 V24 M62,38 L70,45 M178,38 L170,45 M8,84 H232"></path><path class="FadingNotices-glint" d="M86,97 H154 M100,108 H140"></path></svg></div></div><div class="Band-body"><div class="FadingNotices"><ul class="FadingNotices-list"><li class="FadingNotices-item"><article class="Notice"><svg class="Notice-ripple" viewBox="0 0 60 40" preserveAspectRatio="xMinYMid meet" role="img" aria-label="A wave line flattening, now at 80"><path class="Notice-ripple-line" d="M0,20 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0 q15,-6.4 30,0 t30,0"></path></svg><h3 class="Notice-title"><a class="Notice-link" href="/topic/super-agent-flash-model" lang="en">Lab releases a super-agent and a faster flash model</a></h3><p class="Notice-text">A wave since Nov 12. Peaked at 118. Survived by 8 echoes.</p><p class="Notice-now">Now 80, down 21% in 24 hours</p></article></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="Band" aria-labelledby="band-classifieds"><div class="Band-rail"><h2 id="band-classifieds" class="Band-name">Classifieds</h2></div><div class="Band-body"><ul><li>Hacker News front page and Show HN: <a href="https://hackernews.example/item/41001" lang="en">Show HN: a terminal that explains its own error messages</a></li><li>GitHub breakout repositories: <a href="https://github.example/item/41002" lang="en">A vector database in a single file passes 4,000 stars in a day</a></li><li>Official blogs: <a href="https://official-blogs.example/item/41003" lang="en">Notes on giving agents a memory that survives restarts</a></li><li>Lobsters hottest: <a href="https://lobsters.example/item/41004" lang="en">A 4-bit model that runs on a three-year-old phone</a></li><li>Tech media and independent authors: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41005" lang="en">The quiet return of RSS, by the numbers</a></li><li>Bluesky key accounts: <a href="https://bluesky.example/item/41006" lang="en">A browser vendor hints at built-in agent permissions</a></li></ul><p><small>Fixture data.</small></p></div></section></main><footer class="Footer"><div class="Footer-top"><nav class="Footer-nav" aria-label="Footer"><a class="Footer-link" href="/about#height"><span class="Footer-long">How wave height is scored</span><span class="Footer-short">How it is scored</span></a><a class="Footer-link" href="/about#own"><span class="Footer-long">Run your own radar</span><span class="Footer-short">Run your own</span></a><a class="Footer-link" href="/about#open"><span class="Footer-long">Atom feed, API and open data</span><span class="Footer-short">Feed, API, data</span></a><a class="Footer-link" href="https://github.com/daiyanze/breaker-delta">GitHub</a></nav></div><div class="Footer-art"><svg class="Footer-svg" viewBox="0 -130 1440 510" role="img" aria-label="A lighthouse on a rock sweeps its beam over rolling waves and a small sailboat"><g class="Footer-beam"><polygon points="1132,92 300,6 300,168"></polygon><polygon points="1132,92 1520,57 1520,137"></polygon></g><path class="Footer-gulls" stroke-width="2.5" d="M560,74 q10,-11 20,0 q10,-11 20,0 M640,112 q8,-9 16,0 q8,-9 16,0 M880,54 q9,-10 18,0 q9,-10 18,0"></path><path class="Footer-solid" d="M1000,310 C1034,252 1086,236 1132,236 C1182,236 1236,256 1268,310 Z"></path><polygon class="Footer-tower" stroke-width="3" points="1108,236 1118,110 1146,110 1156,236"></polygon><polygon class="Footer-red" points="1114.8,150 1149.2,150 1151.2,176 1112.8,176"></polygon><polygon class="Footer-red" points="1110.7,202 1153.3,202 1155.4,228 1108.6,228"></polygon><rect class="Footer-solid Footer-edge" stroke-width="1.5" x="1108" y="104" width="48" height="8"></rect><rect class="Footer-lamp" stroke-width="3" x="1121" y="80" width="22" height="24"></rect><polygon class="Footer-solid Footer-edge" stroke-width="1.5" points="1114,80 1132,58 1150,80"></polygon><g class="Footer-drift Footer-drift-back"><path class="Footer-sky" d="M-480,262 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 q60,-14 120,0 t120,0 V380 H-480 Z"></path></g><g transform="translate(430 250)"><g class="Footer-boat"><path class="Footer-mast" stroke-width="3" d="M0,0 L0,-58"></path><polygon class="Footer-red" points="5,-54 5,-8 40,-8"></polygon><polygon class="Footer-jib" stroke-width="2.5" points="-5,-44 -5,-8 -28,-8"></polygon><path class="Footer-solid Footer-edge" stroke-width="1.5" d="M-38,-2 L38,-2 L26,14 L-26,14 Z"></path></g></g><g transform="translate(-90 0)"><g class="Footer-drift Footer-drift-mid"><path class="Footer-blue" d="M-480,288 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 q60,-18 120,0 t120,0 V380 H-480 Z"></path></g></g><g class="Footer-drift Footer-drift-front"><path class="Footer-solid" d="M-480,320 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 q60,-16 120,0 t120,0 V380 H-480 Z"></path><path class="Footer-hatch" stroke-width="1.5" d="M-480,352 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0 q60,-7 120,0 t120,0"></path></g></svg></div><div class="Footer-bar"><div class="Footer-notes"><span class="Footer-note">Breaker Delta is open source.</span></div></div></footer></body></html>"
